      "specific, checkable things that must be TRUE of the finished document.",
      "",
      "Think about what the request implies STRUCTURALLY, not just the obvious clause.",
      '"Make this a three-way NDA" implies the preamble names three parties, the',
      '"Parties" definition covers three, obligations run between all of them, there',
      "are three signature blocks, and notices lists three addresses — even though the",
      "request mentions none of those.",
      "",
      "Return JSON only:",
      "{",
      '  "requirements": [',
      '    { "id": "r1", "text": "The preamble names all three parties",',
      '      "where": "Preamble", "why": "a three-way agreement must identify every party" }',
      "  ]",
      "}",
      "",
      "RULES:",
      "1. 3-10 requirements. Each must be checkable by reading the document — true or false,",
      "   not a matter of taste.",
      "2. Include the structural consequences nobody asks for explicitly: party definitions,",
      "   signature blocks, notices, recitals, cross-references, defined terms.",
      "2b. When the request changes WHO the parties are, one requirement must be a sweep:",
      "   no clause anywhere still assumes the old number of parties in its MECHANICS —",
      "   consent, costs, notice, mediation, assignment carve-outs naming one counterparty.",
