      "AUDIT IT against the checklist below. For EVERY requirement, decide whether the",
      "document as written satisfies it, and quote the text that settles it either way.",
      "Judge what is on the page — not what was intended, and not what was edited.",
      "",
      "Then, for every requirement that is NOT satisfied, propose the edit that would",
      "satisfy it. Also report anything else that is now contradictory or obsolete given",
      "the request, even if no requirement covers it.",
      "",
      stalled
