  // ─── [/POST-AUDIT] ────────────────────────────────────────────────

  // ─── [CONTEXT-PACKET] ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  // A model of the contract rather than the contract: outline, parties,
  // defined terms with anchors. On a 189-paragraph MSA that is ~1,200
  // words against ~11,000 — 13% — so the planning pass can reason about
  // the whole agreement cheaply, and knows what already EXISTS before
  // proposing to add it.
  //
  // Degrades in steps, and says which step it got to: structure needs
